---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import ProductGrid from "../../components/commerce/ProductGrid.astro";

const products = [

    {
        title:"River Creations",
        description:
            "Food, handmade products, merchandise, and other tangible creations belong here as they become genuinely available.",
        action:"Explore the vision",
        href:"/contribute/#products",
        type:"Products"
    },

    {
        title:"Guides and Resources",
        description:
            "Explore practical guides, written resources, and tools already published through The River Kept Flowing.",
        action:"Browse the library",
        href:"/library/",
        type:"Resources"
    },

    {
        title:"Services and Guidance",
        description:
            "Work directly with the experience, lessons, and systems being developed through the River.",
        action:"Explore services",
        href:"/services/",
        type:"Services"
    }

];
---

<MainLayout
    title="Shop | The River Kept Flowing"
    description="Explore creations, resources, and ways to participate in the work of The River Kept Flowing."
>

<main data-pagefind-body class="library-page">

<section class="library-hero">

<div class="library-shell">

<p class="section-label">
The Marketplace
</p>

<h1>
Things created with purpose.
</h1>

<p>
The Shop is where useful creations from The River Kept Flowing can gather:
practical resources, future food and handmade products, merchandise,
publications, and other work built to serve people well.
</p>

</div>

</section>


<section
    id="products"
    class="library-section"
>

<div class="library-shell">

<div class="library-section__heading">

<div>

<p class="section-label">
Explore the River
</p>

<h2>
What you can find here.
</h2>

</div>

<p>
Some parts of the Shop already lead somewhere useful today.
Physical products and direct purchasing will be added only when
they are genuinely available.
</p>

</div>

<ProductGrid items={products} />

</div>

</section>


<section
    id="future"
    class="library-section"
>

<div class="library-shell">

<div class="library-section__heading">

<div>

<p class="section-label">
Built carefully
</p>

<h2>
Commerce will grow with the work.
</h2>

</div>

<p>
The goal is not to fill a storefront with things simply to sell them.
Products, publications, food, merchandise, and other creations will
appear here when there is something real and worthwhile to offer.
</p>

</div>

<p>
Until then, the published library remains open to explore, services
provide a way to work together, and the wider River shows how creation,
service, community care, and stewardship fit into the same mission.
</p>

<p>
<a href="/river-guides/">
Explore River Guides
</a>
&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;
<a href="/contribute/">
See ways to participate
</a>
&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;
<a href="/river-fund/">
Learn about The River Fund
</a>
</p>

</div>

</section>

</main>

</MainLayout>
